OL,3,AIran's chief negotiator says Americans
OL,4,Avoted 'no to war'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran's chief negotiator in talks with
OL,7,Fthe US has said that Americans have
OL,8,F"said NO TO WAR", after President
OL,9,FDonald Trump's Republican Party
OL,10,Fsuffered a stunning defeat in the
OL,11,Fmidterm elections.
OL,13,F"We endorse this message," parliament
OL,14,Fspeaker Mohammed Bagher Ghalibaf wrote
OL,15,Fon X.
OL,17,F"If the US [government] betrays their
OL,18,Fpublic will to serve international
OL,19,Fpaymasters and blackmailers, it will
OL,20,Flearn our NO comes with a Nightmare,"
OL,21,Fhe warned.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
