OL,3,AIran's chief negotiator says Americans
OL,4,Avoted 'no to war'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump acknowledged on Tuesday that the
OL,7,Fpoor results for Republican
OL,8,Fcongressional candidates were partly
OL,9,Fdue to the war and the related surge in
OL,10,Fpetrol prices. But he insisted that he
OL,11,Fdid not regret launching a joint attack
OL,12,Fwith Israel on Iran in February.
